WEBVTT

00:14.740 --> 00:15.830
I feel uneasy.

00:16.870 --> 00:18.870
Boy, this place is huge.

00:19.040 --> 00:22.920
<i>Ugh, what is this place?</i>
<i>It's so dark and damp.</i>

00:23.040 --> 00:24.420
<i>This place is definitely bad news.</i>

00:24.550 --> 00:27.970
<i>I already knew the</i>
<i>Monster Association's hideout was bad news</i>

00:28.130 --> 00:30.510
<i>but this is way creepier</i>
<i>than I imagined.</i>

00:30.550 --> 00:32.470
<i>Feels like a monster could attack</i>
<i>at any moment.</i>

00:32.510 --> 00:33.470
Hey, King.

00:33.510 --> 00:38.640
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:34.470 --> 00:36.390
<i>Saitama, where are you?!</i>

00:36.560 --> 00:38.690
- Are you listening to me, King?
- Huh?

00:38.850 --> 00:40.850
Even for someone who’s grown too strong

00:40.900 --> 00:44.980
does a dangerous place like this
still get your blood pumping?

00:45.360 --> 00:47.030
Too strong?

00:47.150 --> 00:48.280
I doubt that.

00:48.280 --> 00:49.860
There's always someone
stronger than you.

00:49.900 --> 00:54.030
Hmm...for the strongest man on Earth,
that’s a surprisingly dull thing to say.

00:54.120 --> 00:57.790
Hmph... Is it so selfish to
hope that might be true?

00:57.950 --> 01:02.080
As expected.
That's how a true warrior should be.

01:02.330 --> 01:04.000
I ought to learn from you.

01:09.510 --> 01:11.760
I DON'T CONSIDER MYSELF A HERO
TRAINING? NOT FOR ME (LOL)

01:11.760 --> 01:13.890
TRYING TO CHALLENGE ME?
WARNING: DON'T DO IT

01:13.890 --> 01:15.890
TOO STRONG? I DOUBT THAT

01:16.470 --> 01:19.520
Yeah... Well, I'm not lying...

01:20.350 --> 01:22.900
We should split up
into two groups from here.

01:23.270 --> 01:24.560
Right, King?

01:24.650 --> 01:26.480
Uh, um...yeah.

01:30.780 --> 01:32.700
Oh. These guys look like they live here.

01:33.200 --> 01:34.120
Hey...

01:36.080 --> 01:40.910
CRASH CRASH CRASH

03:11.050 --> 03:14.970
ULTIMATE LIFEFORM

03:11.920 --> 03:13.720
This chunk of meat...

03:13.880 --> 03:15.090
If we attacked it together

03:14.970 --> 03:17.140
CHOMP CHOMP
CRACK CRUNCH

03:15.130 --> 03:17.090
I thought he would be
a hearty meal for us...

03:17.510 --> 03:20.010
But he ate everybody!

03:20.890 --> 03:21.810
Yikes!

03:22.220 --> 03:23.640
What the heck are you?

03:23.680 --> 03:24.680
You're just a human...

03:24.730 --> 03:27.770
Stop! Don't eat me. Nooo!

03:32.150 --> 03:34.240
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
GUMS

03:54.420 --> 03:56.880
Why aren't you moving?

03:57.130 --> 03:58.550
Have you given up?

03:59.890 --> 04:01.300
What's going on?

04:02.010 --> 04:05.930
Superalloy Blackluster.
Why are you not fighting back?

04:06.390 --> 04:07.730
Insect God.

04:08.230 --> 04:10.730
When we first met,
you told me that...

04:11.400 --> 04:15.240
You're an invincible monster
that embodies the power of insects.

04:15.900 --> 04:18.030
That is exactly
what I've been striving for.

04:18.400 --> 04:20.280
The ultimate form of insect strength!

04:21.530 --> 04:23.530
Their tough exoskeletons and

04:23.580 --> 04:26.830
their perfectly efficient bodies
are impressive...

04:27.500 --> 04:31.830
But the real marvel is that
they're almost entirely made of muscle.

04:32.380 --> 04:34.840
And those muscles barely tire

04:34.920 --> 04:37.630
allowing them to stay active
for long periods.

04:38.090 --> 04:40.800
That is the perfection I aim for!

04:41.470 --> 04:45.270
I was deeply disappointed that a monster
attained it before I did.

04:45.350 --> 04:47.730
But at the same time,
I wanted to experience it for myself.

04:47.810 --> 04:50.190
The power worthy of being
called the Insect God...

04:50.230 --> 04:53.150
That speed...
that terrifying strength...

04:54.230 --> 04:55.070
But...

04:55.190 --> 04:58.240
You're far less impressive
than I expected.

04:58.780 --> 05:00.990
And for a so-called insect monster

05:01.110 --> 05:02.530
you lack the black sheen.

05:02.910 --> 05:03.990
What a letdown...

05:04.080 --> 05:05.200
What did you say?

05:05.490 --> 05:08.580
If you think you've grasped my true power
you're gravely mistaken—

05:08.580 --> 05:10.670
What a letdown!

05:09.960 --> 05:10.830
STARTLED

05:11.330 --> 05:15.460
This body is nothing more
than oversized muscle.

05:15.750 --> 05:19.800
But its performance surpasses yours,
Insect God.

05:20.470 --> 05:22.340
And let me warn you.

05:22.720 --> 05:26.680
There are three heroes
you must never anger.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.770
The strongest creature on Earth, King.

05:30.310 --> 05:35.320
RUMBLE RUMBLE

05:30.310 --> 05:32.810
If you make him angry,
the King Engine will roar

05:32.810 --> 05:35.320
and all evil will be wiped out.

05:35.690 --> 05:39.030
Then there's Tornado,
the psychic capable of untold slaughter!

05:39.650 --> 05:42.950
Tick her off, and she'll pulverize you
beyond recognition.

05:43.530 --> 05:44.870
Finally, there's me.

05:44.990 --> 05:48.580
Superalloy Blackluster,
always gleaming with a dark shine.

05:48.870 --> 05:49.910
Push me too far...

05:49.910 --> 05:52.500
and these muscles start
acting on their own.

05:52.620 --> 05:53.580
I see...

05:53.790 --> 05:56.960
You want to know what happens
if you anger me?

05:57.460 --> 06:00.630
Even the fists of Garou,
the Hero Hunter

06:00.720 --> 06:04.470
who you've all been struggling
to defeat, had no effect on me.

06:04.800 --> 06:07.720
My outer shell is
an impenetrable armor.

06:08.260 --> 06:12.690
The explosive power
of insect muscles is

06:12.730 --> 06:16.190
on a whole different level
from you mammals.

06:16.860 --> 06:19.820
In other words,
my whole body is a weapon.

06:20.110 --> 06:21.900
I'm going to shred
those fake muscles

06:22.030 --> 06:24.860
and feed them to the bugs.

06:25.370 --> 06:26.990
That's reckless.

06:34.620 --> 06:37.000
I'll smash you to bits!!

06:38.750 --> 06:41.010
I told you, that's reckless.

06:41.300 --> 06:46.180
Even I don't know how to
inflict a wound on this body.

06:46.720 --> 06:47.550
Hmm.

06:47.800 --> 06:52.680
Unless it's a top-tier monster,
my muscles don't get fired up.

06:53.640 --> 06:56.230
Whoa. The ground is shaking hard.

06:56.310 --> 06:58.520
Is someone fighting
one of the big shots?

07:04.530 --> 07:06.950
Wow! That's a huge dog!

07:10.030 --> 07:10.870
Oh, I know!

07:13.000 --> 07:14.870
Here you go, doggy.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.080
I'll give you this bone

07:16.330 --> 07:20.920
so take me to the big monster
that's making all this noise.

07:21.250 --> 07:23.800
There, there. Good doggy.

07:27.510 --> 07:28.890
Firing at me without warning?

07:28.890 --> 07:30.470
You need to be taught some discipline.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.940
So you're one of the monsters
making all this noise?

07:38.600 --> 07:39.440
Sit.

08:16.930 --> 08:20.350
Assault team, are you okay?
Respond! What happened?

08:20.810 --> 08:22.440
Damn it. I can't tell what's going on.

08:25.650 --> 08:28.030
Earthquake...?
No, a shock wave...?

08:28.780 --> 08:30.950
No high-energy reactions
detected in the vicinity...

08:31.490 --> 08:33.530
A shockwave from outside
the detection range.

08:33.780 --> 08:35.240
Its power is off the charts.

08:36.000 --> 08:38.250
Which means...
that just now was possibly...

08:39.420 --> 08:42.000
<i>Knowing how steadfast</i>
<i>Master Saitama is</i>

08:42.080 --> 08:44.840
<i>I wouldn't be surprised if</i>
<i>he's already on his way to the hideout.</i>

08:46.670 --> 08:49.720
<i>No way... He took down Pochi</i>
<i>with just one punch...?</i>

08:50.090 --> 08:51.890
<i>He still hasn't noticed me.</i>

08:52.050 --> 08:54.220
<i>This is my chance</i>
<i>to catch him off guard.</i>

08:55.520 --> 08:57.480
Intense Catstigation!

08:57.810 --> 08:58.640
Hm?

09:01.900 --> 09:03.520
First a dog, now a cat?

09:03.610 --> 09:05.320
<i>My claws! They didn't work!</i>

09:05.650 --> 09:07.650
<i>This guy is bad news.</i>

09:07.780 --> 09:11.030
<i>There's no reason to risk my life</i>
<i>for the Monster Association.</i>

09:11.490 --> 09:12.570
<i>I'm outta here, meow!!</i>

09:13.070 --> 09:16.410
Huh? What's his deal?

09:17.290 --> 09:19.540
Oh well, whatever.
Guess I'll get going.

09:20.290 --> 09:22.000
<i>That was loud.</i>

09:22.500 --> 09:26.000
<i>Sounds like Pochi's gone</i>
<i>quiet up there.</i>

09:27.590 --> 09:28.760
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

09:29.130 --> 09:30.800
Getting worried?

09:30.930 --> 09:33.430
Maybe one of your top monsters
got taken out.

09:35.260 --> 09:37.520
So...are you the boss?

09:37.890 --> 09:42.060
Well, well... I'm delighted
you've come all the way here.

09:42.520 --> 09:45.190
Welcome to our hideout, Hero...

09:54.740 --> 09:59.410
I figured you were the one
I'd have to deal with personally...

10:00.580 --> 10:05.040
Terrible Tornado.
The prodigy of supernatural powers.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.750
My name is Gyoro-Gyoro.

10:09.050 --> 10:11.170
I am the strategist of
the Monster Association.

10:11.380 --> 10:15.640
And the creator of the new world
ruled by monsters.

10:15.800 --> 10:19.390
So basically,
you're the boss here, right?

10:19.890 --> 10:20.770
Die.

10:55.720 --> 10:57.140
Is that all you got?

11:06.020 --> 11:08.060
She broke through my barrier?!

11:08.270 --> 11:11.190
Damn it... This could get ugly.

11:11.780 --> 11:15.240
Very well. I won't hold back either.

11:15.490 --> 11:17.740
I'll fight you in my true form!

11:20.280 --> 11:24.460
Tornado! Is this your first time facing
a psychic superior than yourself?

11:24.790 --> 11:26.540
Well, have fun.

11:26.790 --> 11:28.880
Super Raging Waves of Gravity.

11:31.170 --> 11:32.840
300 times gravity!

11:33.300 --> 11:35.840
I'll flatten you like a pancake.

11:37.390 --> 11:39.010
Not bad for a high ranker.

11:39.140 --> 11:40.390
Feels pretty good.

11:40.640 --> 11:43.180
But can you apply more pressure
on my right shoulder?

11:43.560 --> 11:46.310
I recently changed my pillow
and my shoulder's stiff.

11:46.480 --> 11:49.230
Why you...!!

11:55.990 --> 11:58.860
Huh? Oh...huh?

11:58.990 --> 11:59.950
Whoa, wait.

12:04.750 --> 12:07.750
<i>Damn woman!</i>

12:07.870 --> 12:11.540
<i>She's much more powerful</i>
<i>than I expected.</i>

12:12.040 --> 12:14.420
She’s leagues above
her younger sister...!

12:14.630 --> 12:16.510
Alright, I get it. You're powerful.

12:16.630 --> 12:20.260
But you didn't have to kill me
so gruesomely.

12:20.640 --> 12:23.810
You're so cruel, Terrible Tornado.

12:24.220 --> 12:26.770
You're just a lump of meat
that feels no pain.

12:26.770 --> 12:28.440
What are you talking about?

12:28.980 --> 12:30.810
Now I'm going to draw out
your true form.

12:31.190 --> 12:34.150
<i>Oh no, she saw right through me.</i>

12:34.610 --> 12:37.950
<i>I wasn't ready...to challenge her...</i>

12:38.360 --> 12:41.370
<i>In that case...</i>
<i>there is only one option left.</i>

12:41.950 --> 12:46.370
Lord Orochi! Please help me.

12:46.500 --> 12:50.960
Please take this woman down!
Lord Orochi!

12:51.080 --> 12:56.210
Orochi? Oh yeah,
someone did mention that name.

12:56.420 --> 13:01.430
I may be the commander,
but our boss is Monster King Orochi.

13:01.550 --> 13:03.430
Even as the one who
created this true monster

13:03.430 --> 13:06.180
I can’t fathom the limits
of his boundless power.

13:07.640 --> 13:11.150
It's over for you, Tornado.

13:12.900 --> 13:13.770
Hmm?

13:13.810 --> 13:15.730
Huh...? No one's coming.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.110
<i>Why? That's strange.</i>

13:18.490 --> 13:23.570
<i>I've brainwashed him to</i>
<i>never defy my orders.</i>

13:23.780 --> 13:26.620
Maybe he's too busy
to come save you.

13:27.120 --> 13:30.290
Maybe he's facing off with
some other hero right now.

13:30.710 --> 13:32.250
They're no match for me

13:32.370 --> 13:34.290
but I hear the others
are pretty strong too.

13:34.420 --> 13:35.710
W-Wait. Wait just a minute.

13:36.000 --> 13:39.670
Let's calm down and
talk this over. Okay?

13:44.180 --> 13:48.270
<i>There's an opponent so powerful</i>
<i>he would ignore my plight?</i>

13:49.020 --> 13:51.350
<i>No, that can't be.</i>
<i>I'm up against Tornado here!</i>

13:51.890 --> 13:53.600
<i>Hurry up and get over here.</i>

13:54.100 --> 13:55.650
<i>Where did he go?</i>

14:10.500 --> 14:13.670
First, a couple of naked guys,
then a dog and a cat.

14:13.830 --> 14:15.580
I was wondering what's coming next...

14:16.340 --> 14:18.590
And now,
something utterly absurd shows up.

14:26.010 --> 14:28.310
I live right above here.

14:28.510 --> 14:31.270
I heard some noise, so I went out
for a walk to check it out.

14:32.890 --> 14:35.020
That shockwave from earlier...

14:35.730 --> 14:38.360
It was out of the ordinary,
so I came to see for myself.

14:39.190 --> 14:41.440
It wasn't even on the watch list.

14:41.900 --> 14:46.320
An unforeseen, formidable presence
that could pose a real threat to us...

14:47.030 --> 14:49.790
It must be destroyed now
or it could be dangerous.

14:51.080 --> 14:54.250
We? So that means
you guys living here

14:54.250 --> 14:56.000
are all in the same group
or something?

14:56.250 --> 14:59.040
You're out here talking about
threats and danger, but...

14:59.800 --> 15:02.050
I'm the one being attacked here.

15:02.460 --> 15:03.800
I'm just fighting back.

15:10.100 --> 15:11.930
So you're going to attack me, huh?

15:14.480 --> 15:18.480
You're alive, Pochi?
Kill this human.

15:20.070 --> 15:21.400
Dang it, I got burnt!

15:32.240 --> 15:34.040
What did you do to Pochi?

15:34.580 --> 15:35.540
I punched it.

15:36.040 --> 15:38.170
How dare you burn my cape.

15:41.500 --> 15:43.800
You're definitely a monster.

15:43.960 --> 15:46.300
So I'm not holding back.
You're gonna get a normal punch.

15:46.680 --> 15:48.340
<i>He held back against Pochi...?</i>

15:48.680 --> 15:50.640
<i>No, that wasn't a bluff.</i>

15:51.140 --> 15:54.640
<i>The monster cells within me</i>
<i>are roaring.</i>

15:55.350 --> 15:58.020
<i>I see now. So it was him.</i>

15:58.020 --> 16:00.610
<i>That inexplicable presence I sensed...</i>

16:01.320 --> 16:04.360
<i>Goketsu...Centichoro...</i>

16:04.990 --> 16:08.780
<i>The beast rumored to live</i>
<i>in the ghost town above.</i>

16:09.410 --> 16:12.990
<i>Neither the Monster Association</i>
<i>nor I were responsible.</i>

16:13.120 --> 16:14.330
<i>It was this man!</i>

16:16.790 --> 16:20.330
<i>I haven't been this excited</i>
<i>in a long time.</i>

16:22.290 --> 16:25.760
<i>Every monster cell</i>
<i>within me senses it.</i>

16:25.880 --> 16:30.300
<i>This man is the perfect sacrifice</i>
<i>for my resurrection.</i>

16:33.640 --> 16:36.850
Looks like this will be
the final showdown.

16:40.230 --> 16:42.480
I'm interested in you.

16:42.860 --> 16:46.900
The peak of biological strength
a human can attain.

16:47.030 --> 16:50.110
How far can it hold up against me?

16:50.610 --> 16:52.910
I'm looking forward to this.

16:54.120 --> 16:58.580
Can you awaken my ego and
emotions that were shrouded in a haze?

16:59.830 --> 17:04.170
Through countless sacrifices,
I have become the ultimate lifeform.

17:05.170 --> 17:06.340
Under Gyoro-Gyoro

17:06.340 --> 17:11.680
I endured endless fusion and combat
experiments with the strongest warriors.

17:11.970 --> 17:15.260
I evolved from a human
into an extraordinary monster...

17:15.260 --> 17:16.680
The ultimate being.

17:18.850 --> 17:23.400
Fate led you here as my sacrifice.

17:23.650 --> 17:27.070
Come, fight me like
it's a combat experiment

17:27.070 --> 17:29.030
and offer your body to me.

17:29.700 --> 17:33.240
For I am a god whose rebirth
was foretold in ancient times

17:33.240 --> 17:36.160
and destined to
descend upon this world...

17:36.370 --> 17:37.950
-I am Oroch—
-Hey, that's enough.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.250
I'm not interested in you at all.

17:40.660 --> 17:43.040
Don't get all worked up by yourself...

17:43.460 --> 17:46.460
I'm sick of hearing introductions
like that. No offense.

17:47.130 --> 17:49.840
King of so-and-so...
Ancient weapon so-and-so...

17:49.880 --> 17:53.220
Final evolution so-and-so...
So-and-so of the entire universe...

17:53.340 --> 17:54.850
Blah blah blah.

17:55.760 --> 17:58.560
I've dealt with plenty like you before.

17:59.020 --> 18:00.600
So what makes you different
from them?

18:01.640 --> 18:03.600
Even if you call yourself
the ultimate being...

18:03.730 --> 18:05.440
You're still going down
in one punch anyway.

18:07.230 --> 18:08.820
Guess you were just bored.

18:09.780 --> 18:11.820
You got stronger

18:11.820 --> 18:14.200
but you got that confused
with reaching your goal.

18:15.200 --> 18:18.080
Bring it on.
But I'm not expecting much.

18:18.370 --> 18:21.540
I am destined to become a god!

18:44.020 --> 18:47.900
So in a monster hideout,
lightning can come up from underground?

18:48.020 --> 18:49.860
ZAP

19:37.660 --> 19:39.780
What...did you just...do...?

19:40.530 --> 19:42.540
Huh...? Just a normal punch.

19:43.620 --> 19:44.580
<i>So this is...</i>

19:45.330 --> 19:46.460
<i>...fear.</i>

21:45.030 --> 21:46.830
RUMBLE RUMBLE

21:47.120 --> 21:49.080
Split up into two groups, huh?

21:49.660 --> 21:52.040
In that case,
I'll follow your lead, Silverfang.

21:52.580 --> 21:55.670
All right,
then you can go that way.

21:56.000 --> 21:56.840
<i>What?</i>

21:57.170 --> 21:59.260
That means we'll go this way.

21:59.420 --> 22:01.170
Uh-huh.. Then let's go.

22:01.430 --> 22:04.470
<i>That's not what I meant</i>
<i>by "follow your lead."</i>

22:01.430 --> 22:08.430
RUMBLE RUMBLE

22:05.350 --> 22:08.470
<i>Normally, four people should be split up</i>
<i>into two groups of two.</i>

22:08.600 --> 22:09.680
<i>That's just common sense.</i>

22:10.020 --> 22:12.190
<i>Why do I have to end up alone?</i>

22:13.400 --> 22:15.020
<i>Oh well. I'll just deal with it.</i>

22:15.610 --> 22:18.320
<i>Until the strong heroes</i>
<i>wipe out the enemy</i>

22:18.320 --> 22:20.360
<i>I'll hide my presence and</i>
<i>stay out of sight.</i>

22:20.990 --> 22:21.900
Phew...

22:21.990 --> 22:23.990
<i>I'll imagine that I'm a cloud.</i>

22:24.240 --> 22:27.330
<i>No, that sounds too grand.</i>
<i>I can't relate to that.</i>

22:27.580 --> 22:29.870
<i>I can be a</i>
<i>motionless microorganism that is</i>

22:29.870 --> 22:31.540
<i>unseen, unnoticed,</i>
<i>and bothering no one.</i>

22:31.710 --> 22:33.210
<i>That doesn't feel right either.</i>

22:33.540 --> 22:35.170
<i>I'm a being that is close</i>
<i>to nothingness</i>

22:35.170 --> 22:37.040
<i>and I just float around.</i>

22:37.170 --> 22:38.000
King?

22:39.250 --> 22:40.130
Huh!?

22:41.720 --> 22:44.590
<i>That hostage kid...?!</i>
<i>Why is he in front of me?</i>

22:45.760 --> 22:47.050
I was so scared!

22:47.180 --> 22:49.310
I've been running away
all alone this whole time.

22:49.350 --> 22:52.180
There's a monster coming
after me from that way.

22:52.430 --> 22:54.390
But now that King is here,
I'm safe, right?

22:54.560 --> 22:55.650
Can you protect me?

22:55.900 --> 22:58.570
Carry me on your back
and take me to the exit!

22:59.190 --> 23:02.240
No. Well, um...that's...uh...

23:03.400 --> 23:10.410
RUMBLE RUMBLE

23:04.280 --> 23:05.780
<i>That sound. Is that the King Engine?</i>

23:06.110 --> 23:08.450
Um...You don't want me.

23:08.950 --> 23:12.410
It would be wiser to find
a different hero.

23:12.500 --> 23:19.500
RUMBLE RUMBLE

23:12.830 --> 23:15.790
Even if you rely on me,
I can't be of any help.

23:16.250 --> 23:19.540
If I try to help you, you'll only end up
being disappointed.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.420
<i>He already saw through me?</i>

23:21.670 --> 23:23.720
<i>But my disguise was perfect.</i>

23:23.920 --> 23:28.720
RUMBLE RUMBLE

23:24.170 --> 23:25.550
<i>Oh no. I'm screwed.</i>

23:25.680 --> 23:27.180
<i>I'm so scared. Crap.</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:28.800
<i>My transformation is falling apart.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:36.230
<i>Huh? What happened?</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:39.610
RUMBLE RUMBLE

23:36.270 --> 23:39.610
<i>I'm scared. Help me, Saitama.</i>

23:46.280 --> 23:47.410
Told you so.

23:47.410 --> 23:49.450
I ended it with just one punch again.
